ck is the focal point, exuding elegance and grace. Tack sharp, with many details. Other elements of wildlife, like colorful butterflies and exotic birds, add life to the scene, enhancing the overall photographic quality.", "a photo of a majestic, vividly colored peacock standing proudly in an exotic, lush jungle. The bird's feathers display an iridescent array of blues, greens, and purples, with intricate eye patterns. Taken with a Canon EOS 5D Mark IV and a Canon EF 100-400mm f/4.5-5.6L IS II USM lens at 200mm, the scene includes tropical plants, vibrant flowers, and distant waterfalls under a bright, sunny sky, creating a rich and detailed paradise setting. The peacock is the focal point, exuding elegance and grace. Tack sharp, with many details. Other elements of wildlife, like colorful butterflies and exotic birds, add life to the scene, enhancing the overall photographic quality.", 3.5], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 140, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP"}], "flags": {}, "id": 38, "type": "CLIPTextEncodeFlux", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncodeFlux"}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": {"0": 447.607177734375, "1": 461.6881103515625}, "pos": [244, 1005], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 95, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE"}], "flags": {}, "id": 67, "type": "PreviewImage", "title": "Default preview image (no detailer)", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "PreviewImage"}, "order": 22}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 3, "name": "output", "slot_index": 0, "links": [101], "label": "output", "type": "LATENT"}, {"shape": 3, "name": "denoised_output", "slot_index": 1, "links": [], "label": "denoised_output", "type": "LATENT"}], "size": {"0": 355.20001220703125, "1": 106}, "pos": [-30, 1159], "inputs": [{"name": "noise", "link": 97, "label": "noise", "type": "NOISE"}, {"name": "guider", "link": 98, "label": "guider", "type": "GUIDER"}, {"name": "sampler", "link": 99, "label": "sampler", "type": "SAMPLER"}, {"name": "sigmas", "